    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 21 · Consent\nCalled from 03/08 (keyword gate, before any AI), 04 (router STOP), 24A (voice opt-out).\nKeywords: STOP · STOPALL · UNSUBSCRIBE · CANCEL · END · QUIT · OPT OUT · \"do not contact me\" (see `rr_is_opt_out`).\nTwilio also auto-replies to STOP/START on standard numbers — we record, we don't double-reply.\n`rr_can_contact()` is re-checked by 07 at send time.",
        "width": 600,
